{"id": "63432", "title": "重回少女时代", "author": "翠寒烟", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 69, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63432.htm", "intro": "赫敏爱上了马尔福，可他并不知道。她穿越时空寻找过去的缘分。她最快乐的记忆不是格兰芬多铁三角，不是图书馆，不是四年级的圣诞舞会，不是收到11张OWLs证书——而是某个闲暇的午后，泡上一杯香浓的红茶，慵懒的靠着扶手椅背，听着缠绵轻悠的音乐，静静欣赏德拉科氠尔福安静的睡颜，替他念一首自己最喜欢的诗。暖暖的，柔柔的阳光斜着穿过敞开的门窗，他的发丝耀人眼目，柔和了马尔福庄园常年阴冷灰暗的色调。霍格沃兹的时间魔法会为他们扭转命运。", "base": "files/article/html/63/63432", "chapters": [{"title": "第 1 章", "file": "9375452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "9375453.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "9375454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "9375455.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "9375457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "9375459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "9375460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "9375461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "9375463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "9375466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "9375468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 12 章", "file": "9375469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "9375471.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 14 章", "file": "9375473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "9375475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 16 章", "file": "9375477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 17 章", "file": "9375478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 18 章", "file": "9375480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 19 章", "file": "9375481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 20 章", "file": "9375482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 21 章", "file": "9375484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 22 章", "file": "9375486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 23 章", "file": "9375488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 24 章", "file": "9375490.html", "available": false